OL,3,GNEWSATeen admits bank holiday stabbing
OL,4,Aon beach that left 17-year-old with
OL,5,Aamputated leg
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teenager has admitted stabbing a
OL,8,F17-year-old boy in an "unprovoked"
OL,9,Fattack which led to him having his leg
OL,10,Famputated.
OL,12,FNewport Crown Court heard the boy, who
OL,13,Fcannot be named because of his age, was
OL,14,Fvisiting the beach with a group of
OL,15,Ffriends in May 2026, when the incident
OL,16,Fhappened during a bank holiday trip to
OL,17,FBarry Island.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
