OL,3,GNEWSATeen admits bank holiday stabbing
OL,4,Aon beach that left 17-year-old with
OL,5,Aamputated leg
OL,6,
OL,7,FIdris Ahmed, from Riverside in Cardiff,
OL,8,Fpreviously denied grievous bodily harm
OL,9,Fwith intent and possessing a knife -
OL,10,Fbut changed his plea to guilty on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FAhmed, 19, attacked the teenager
OL,14,F"without warning" after the victim
OL,15,Facted "as a peacemaker" between the
OL,16,Fgroup Ahmed was socialising with and
OL,17,Fthose in his own party. Ahmed is
OL,18,Fexpected to be sentenced on 27
OL,19,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
